500", "image": "engenn7le18ob03re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I haven't had time to have people over in the past month. I've been itching to try some of these rice dishes for a bit now.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It's been quite a while since we've done anything like this. Have you decided whether to invite Marleene?", "id": 3, "time": "30500", "image": "engenn7le18ob03re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Maybe. I think a new perspective would help a bit. I haven't had an honest critique from an outsider in a while!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I have been going out more lately. I've gone to the pub and bowling with my colleagues a few times. I haven't been having dinner out with them though. They eat in terrible places!", "id": 4, "time": "42000", "image": "engenn7le18ob03re2img02.jpg"}]}}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "The Rice Cookout"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Rice It Up!"}, {"type": "position", "content": 3}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 18}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Identify and describe events in a range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Present Perfect Continuous vs. Present Perfect"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Present Perfect tense to talk about an unspecified time in the past that is related to now or continues up to now. <br/>When you use the Present Perfect Continuous tense, the time when the action happened is also not important."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use the Present Perfect tense to talk about:<ul><li>experience up to the present</li><li>change that has happened over time</li><li>an event or action that happened in the past that is important now</li></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Present Perfect tense: Statements, Questions and Negatives"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Subject + <span class=\"italic\">have</span>/<span class=\"italic\">had</span> + past participle (statement)<br/>Subject + <span class=\"italic\">have</span>/<span class=\"italic\">had</span> + <span class=\"italic\">not</span> + past participle (negative)<br/><span class=\"italic\">How long</span> + <span class=\"italic\">have</span>/<span class=\"italic\">had</span> + subject  + past participle ? (question)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the Present Perfect Continuous<ul><li>to emphasize that action has continued without stopping until now and may still be taking place</li><li>when we can see the result of an action that happened in the recent past, now</li></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Present Perfect Continuous tense: Statements, Questions and Negatives"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Subject + <span class=\"italic\">have</span>/<span class=\"italic\">had</span> + past participle + <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span>. (statement)<br/>Subject + <span class=\"italic\">have</span>/<span class=\"italic\">had</span> + <span class=\"italic\">not</span> + past participle + <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span>. (negative)<br/><span class=\"italic\">How long</span> + <span class=\"italic\">have</span>/<span class=\"italic\">had</span> + subject  + past participle + <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span>? (question)"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Perfect tense</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Perfect Continuous tense</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><p>It seems like we've waited for hours. </p><p>I haven't had time to have people over in the past month.</p><p>How long have you waited?</p></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><p>I've been spending more and more time in specialty food emporiums.</p><p>I haven't been having dinner out with them though.</p><p>How long have you been collecting recipes?</p></span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " <span class=\"italic\">Since</span>, <span class=\"italic\">For</span>, and <span class=\"italic\">In</span> for Duration"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you use the Present Perfect tense and the Present Perfect Continuous tense, you often use phrases or clauses for duration."}, {"type": "text", "content": "These phrases or clauses begin with <span class=\"italic\">for</span>, <span class=\"italic\">in</span> or <span class=\"italic\">since</span>. They tell you how long someone/something has done or has been doing an action."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use <span class=\"italic\">since</span> to begin a phrase or a clause (as a connector or as a preposition)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">for</span> and <span class=\"italic\">in</span> to begin a phrase (as a preposition)."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Preposition</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Example</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"for\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"for years!<br/>for a bit now<br/>for 400 years\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"since\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"since then\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"in\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"in the past month<br/>in a while!\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Connector</span></div>\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"since\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"since I was a kid<br/>since I started college\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I've been collecting recipes since I was a kid."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I've been into cooking in a big way since I started college."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Aunt Nelly has been encouraging me to follow this career path for years!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I haven't had an honest critique from an outsider in a while!"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "specialty"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "for a particular taste"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This shop sells specialty foods."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le18ob03aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about cooking."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "emporium"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a store that sells special foods"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This emporium imports greek food."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le18ob03aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "eye-opener"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "something that makes you see something in a different way"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Shopping for food can be a real eye-opener!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le18ob03aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "a bit"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a small amount of time"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I've wanted to come here for a bit."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le18ob03aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to itch"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to want to do something very badly"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm itching to try this new recipe."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le18ob03aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "outsider"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "someone not in the group"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: A compliment from an outsider is always nice."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le18ob03aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to critique"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to look at critically to assess good and bad points"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He always critiques the food when we eat in a restaurant."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le18ob03aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pub"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a British style bar"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We had lunch in a British-style pub."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le18ob03aud09"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to be taken with"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to admire"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have always been taken with recipe books."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le18ob03aud05"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn7le18ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Talk about what you and your friends or family have been doing on weekends."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a paragraph about who you've been going with."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Say where you've been going."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Has it cost you money to go there or has it been free?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your paragraph aloud to a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about what I've been doing on weekends."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write about activities I've been doing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I say who has been with me."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I say whether it has cost money to do this."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I share my paragraph with a partner."}]}], "type": "sena"}